      "contentType": "text",
      "media": [],
      "hasMediaInOriginal": false,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "01 August 2026 Current Affairs in Hindi & English\n\n➼ M. Sreeshankar ने Glasgow Commonwealth Games 2026 की पुरुष Long Jump स्पर्धा में 8.09 मीटर की छलांग लगाकर रजत पदक जीता।\nM. Sreeshankar won the Silver Medal in the men’s Long Jump event at the Glasgow Commonwealth Games 2026 with a jump of 8.09 metres.\n\n➼ Dilip Gavit ने 2026 Commonwealth Games की पुरुष 100m T47 Sprint स्पर्धा में 10.71 सेकंड के गेम्स रिकॉर्ड के साथ स्वर्ण पदक जीता।\nDilip Gavit won the Gold Medal in the men’s 100m T47 Sprint event at the 2026 Commonwealth Games with a Games Record time of 10.71 seconds.\n\n➼ ‘The New Me 2.0’ पुस्तक के लेखक Gagan Dhawan हैं।\nThe book ‘The New Me 2.0’ is authored by Gagan Dhawan.\n\n➼ संसद ने Public Examinations (Prevention of Unfair Means) Amendment Bill, 2026 पारित किया।\nParliament passed the Public Examinations (Prevention of Unfair Means) Amendment Bill, 2026.\n\n➼ West Bengal का पहला समर्पित NIA Police Station New Town, Kolkata में स्थापित किया गया।\nWest Bengal’s first dedicated NIA Police Station has been established at New Town, Kolkata.\n\n➼ BITS Pilani, Hyderabad Campus ने Biopharmaceutical Wastewater के उपचार एवं पुनः उपयोग के लिए Low-Energy Technology विकसित की।\nBITS Pilani, Hyderabad Campus developed a low-energy technology for treating and reusing biopharmaceutical wastewater.\n\n➼ भारत के पहले All-Female Tri-Service Circumnavigation Sailing Expedition का नाम Samudra Pradakshina है।\nIndia’s first all-female tri-service circumnavigation sailing expedition is named Samudra Pradakshina.\n\n➼ South Africa के Chad le Clos ने अपना 21वाँ पदक जीतकर Commonwealth Games इतिहास के सबसे सफल खिलाड़ी बनने का रिकॉर्ड बनाया।\nChad le Clos of South Africa became the most decorated athlete in Commonwealth Games history after winning his 21st medal.\n\n➼ 22वीं Commonwealth Table Tennis Championship के पुरुष एवं महिला टीम फाइनल में भारत ने Malaysia को हराया।\nIndia defeated Malaysia in both the men’s and women’s team finals of the 22nd Commonwealth Table Tennis Championship.\n\n➼ Mahanadi Water-Sharing Dispute मुख्य रूप से Odisha और Chhattisgarh के बीच है।\nThe Mahanadi water-sharing dispute is primarily between Odisha and Chhattisgarh.\n\n➼ ‘Heartland Rising: The Making of Majoritarian India’ पुस्तक के लेखक Javed Gaya हैं।\nThe book ‘Heartland Rising: The Making of Majoritarian India’ is authored by Javed Gaya.\n\n➼ भारतीय हॉकी टीम ने World Cup से पहले अपनी जर्सी का रंग Blue से बदलकर Saffron किया।\nThe Indian hockey team changed its jersey colour from Blue to Saffron ahead of the World Cup.\n\n➼ CRPF ने हाल ही में अपना 88वाँ स्थापना दिवस (Raising Day) मनाया।\nThe CRPF recently celebrated its 88th Raising Day.\n\n➼ विदेश मंत्री S. Jaishankar ने बंगाल की खाड़ी क्षेत्र के लिए SHANTI Framework प्रस्तुत किया।\nExternal Affairs Minister S. Jaishankar presented the SHANTI Framework for maritime security cooperation in the Bay of Bengal region.",
